WEBVTT

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:12.190
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:17.420
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.560
Do you think everyone is back to normal?

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.110
They should be.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:34.680
This is a bit nerve-wracking.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.820
Oh, you're back.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.230
Hey, the juniors shouldn't be keeping their seniors waiting.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.170
That's right.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.820
You're back to normal!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.080
Thank goodness!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.660
Are you all okay now?

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:50.690
Yeah.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:55.260
I did feel as if something was wrong, but everything's okay now.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.780
Yeah, right now I feel pretty fine.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.160
My heart feels so serene.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.910
You guys were under mind control, but now you're free of it since we beat Beta.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.670
I wasn't even aware of that.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.500
Anyway, for the present, things are how it should be!

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.900
No.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.010
We're still missing Coach Endou, and Daisuke-san isn't back to normal yet.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:21.720
In order to restore everything to the way it was, we need the strongest eleven in history!

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.850
Now hold on, at least take a moment to be happy that the soccer club is back.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.560
That's right, Tenma!

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.940
You ought to say something as our captain!

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.670
Okay then...

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.280
I ask all of you.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.030
Do you like soccer?!

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.700
Yeah!

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:43.200
This is great.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.710
The soccer club is back... Everyone is back!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:38.250
It's been awhile, so why don't we all go practice?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.430
Good idea! Let's do it!

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.070
Wait, Tenma-kun!

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.970
Soccer is still banned.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:45.930
Oh, that's right.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:50.340
Gouenji-san is helping us to delay the school from demolishing the soccer building, at least.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.450
They won't find us out easily in here.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.670
I guess that's true.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:02.930
Captain! Welcome back!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.400
Who's she?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.140
No idea...

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.220
Soccer club, hiya!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:10.880
Hello...

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:13.120
Um, who are you?

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.620
Who am I?

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:19.410
Captain, don't joke like that!

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.180
I'm the ace striker!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:23.820
Ace... striker?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.490
That's Raimon's uniform!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.250
Are you interested in joining the managers?

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.120
Is that it?

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.440
Captain Tenma, you're so funny.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.930
C'mon, Captain.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:41.450
Did all of that time traveling make you forget about our team member?

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:43.470
That's right.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.220
Look!

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.680
Since I won against Tsurugi in our striker showdown the other day,

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.020
I'm the team's ace striker right now.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.030
Another time paradox occurred.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.840
I-Is that right?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.330
By the way, um...

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.980
What's your name?

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.610
Oh, if you insist.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.580
Let me re-introduce myself.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.180
I'm Nanobana Kinako!

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.620
Nice to meet you!

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:22.380
Oh, but I guess stealing the ace number wasn't a great idea.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.050
I'll take it off.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.200
No, no, wait, wait!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.220
Don't look!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.680
Who is that girl?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.740
She doesn't exist in the standard time route.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.850
She goes by the name of Nanobana Kinako.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.720
So, she's a singularity that someone has planted within the time route, eh?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.250
Investigate at once.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.170
Yes, sir.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.950
Mixi-trans!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:49.860
Nobunaga!

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.160
This is Nobunaga's power, huh?

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.170
Well, show me what you can do!

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.930
Split-second Boost!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.350
Amazing, Shindou!

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.130
Nothing less from you!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.280
With this power, we just might be able to beat El Dorado!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.200
Too awesome!

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.820
No, I still don't have full mastery of it.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.330
I need to keep training more.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:41.870
All right, everyone.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.710
It's time we got going again.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.340
To the next in line for the strongest eleven in history!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.420
Good ideba!

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:51.890
Now, for No. 2 of the strongest eleven in history...

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:53.300
Yes, sir.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.460
Our next target is...

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:03.060
Power #2: A charismatic defender who rouses up his team's courage, changing it into an iron-wall defense.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.390
U-Um...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.180
Hmm, me?

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.770
That thing you say after!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.190
When you give someone as an example.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:21.650
In that case...

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.570
Power #2.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:29.510
A charismatic defender who rouses up his team's courage, changing it into an iron-wall defense.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.710
For instance...

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.880
Jeanne d'Arc!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.230
Jeanne...

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.050
D'Arc?

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:45.270
Jeanne d'Arc was a charismatic soldier who lead her troops to victory in a historical war.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:49.280
She was even said to have heard voices from God.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.700
That sounds wonderful!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:52.650
Here!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:56.710
Since we're both girls, how about I do it?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.630
I'll do my best!

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.500
Okay then, it's in your hands!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.250
That's it?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.160
Isn't it usually how stuff like this goes?

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.620
I don't think so...

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.580
I've already arranged for the Artifact to be procured.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.460
By who?

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.050
So, I have a suggestion.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.970
I'd like only eleven of us to go for this time jump.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.960
You want to restrict our numbers?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.300
That's right.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.240
Why?

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:25.190
We should keep our numbers low, in order to keep any bad influences on the time route to a minimum.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.610
Then, as Coach, I will decide which members should go!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:34.400
No, I will decide since members with the possibility of Mixi-maxing should be taken into consideration!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.530
Hey, you're just a rock!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.370
At least I'm better than you!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.680
Hold it!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.380
How can a bear be less worthier than a rock! This is the utmost-

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.110
Now, now, you two.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:48.070
Wondeba, I think we should let Daisuke-san handle this one.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.500
Fine.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.590
We should be able to obtain the Artifact by tomorrow.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.250
Therefore, we will leave tomorrow.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.490
What about the members for this trip?

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.640
I'll decide that by tomorrow.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.640
Jeanne d'Arc, huh?

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.590
Don't, you're embarrassing me!

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.860
We used to train a lot together in the past.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:29.630
But I was always the one chasing after you.

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.390
Even now, I still look at you from behind.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.090
Kirino-senpai.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:38.970
Kariya...

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.890
I sure am hungry.

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.080
Is something wrong?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.630
No, nothing.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:48.900
Bye.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.860
C'mon, let's play games.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.990
You mean that one again?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.270
Didn't you learn from last time?

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:00.450
Hey, it's fun! Right?

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:08.960
What's your problem?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.460
Mind Control Mode.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:20.710
I am on fire today!

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.140
Sure, Hamano-kun, you managed to catch ten of them.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.710
All I caught was one.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:27.980
What about you, Kurama-kun?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.900
I got...

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:30.660
Zero.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:33.630
See, even Kurama-kun didn't manage to get a single fish.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.110
Shut up.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:36.260
What about you guys?

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.280
Nada.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:37.700
Same.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:43.370
What?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:49.650
What are you doing?

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.130
Let's play soccer.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.660
What?

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.440
We'll fight through soccer.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.590
A soccer battle.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.550
The goals are over there and over there.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.050
So, let's start.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.110
What's with these guys?

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.360
They're actually pretty good!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.610
We can't lose to them!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.320
Won't we get in trouble if we're seen playing soccer right now?

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:23.660
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:25.790
Hamano!

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:27.080
Okay!

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:30.410
Here I go!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.750
Sidewinder!

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:43.700
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.890
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.970
That happened to you yesterday?

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:54.650
Yeah.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.650
It was over in seconds with my shoot, though.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.040
We were attacked too.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.640
But we beat them, naturally.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.980
For you, too?

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:05.820
That's strange.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:10.330
Why challenge us with soccer when there's a soccer ban right now?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.510
I can only think of one reason.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:16.920
Protocol Omega must have put them under mind control.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:20.330
They probably plan to use soccer this way to beat Raimon's members.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:25.090
Then, by planting feelings of disappointment towards soccer, they'll turn that disappointment into hatred.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.110
Could it be...

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.800
The work of that new guy who replaced Beta?

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.660
That appears to be the case.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.840
They haven't given up yet.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:37.670
Gouenji-san!

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:42.620
El Dorado isn't satisfied with just banning soccer.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.450
They're moving towards eliminating soccer completely.

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:50.310
There are some among those with a deep-seated love for soccer who still play in secret.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:53.410
Those people in particular have been attacked one after the other recently.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.920
That's exactly how those guys would treat them!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.790
Yeah, that's for sure.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:03.260
They're trying to erase soccer completely in this time period.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:03.920
We need to hurry.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.030
Gouenji, did you get what I asked for?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:08.680
Yes.

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.010
The Artifact for Jeanne d'Arc.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.460
The helmet of courage.

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:16.980
It was Gouenji-san you asked help from?!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.420
Shindou, try it on.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.800
No, that's okay.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.930
Nobunaga would wear a helmet, wouldn't he?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.450
His helmet and this helmet are two different things!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.490
I think I want to see you wearing it.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:30.160
Then I'll wear it!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.590
What's wrong, Kirino-senpai?

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.450
Cut it out, Nishiki!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.320
I wanna wear it!

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.510
Nothing.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:37.210
Are you still feeling sore over Shindou-senpai?

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.460
I'm not thinking that way about Shindou at all!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.670
You're so transparent.

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:46.670
What?!

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:49.870
Even you feel jealousy, huh?

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:50.630
I see...

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.420
Jealousy? Me?

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:59.460
Shindou-senpai has an Avatar, and now he can even Mixi-max and use Avatar Armed.

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.560
He's bounded so far ahead that you can't reach him.

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:04.100
That's pretty much what you're thinking, isn't it?

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:05.560
No!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:06.690
Don't make nosy assumptions!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:11.240
Now, I will announce the members who will be participating in this time jump.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.820
This is the player list that does not include managers.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:16.580
Matsukaze!

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:17.580
Shindou!

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:18.580
Tsurugi!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:19.580
Fei!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.000
Nishizono!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:21.580
Nishiki!

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.180
Kariya!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:23.580
Hamano!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.100
Kageyama!

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:26.190
Hayami!

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:27.270
And...

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:28.460
Nanobana!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.300
That is all.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:33.430
All right! I'll do my best!

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:37.000
We'll be time jumping in one hour.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.620
Pack up whatever things you need.

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.800
You're only allowed 300¥ to buy snacks.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:42.980
That joke is so last century!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.670
I don't think 300¥ is enough...

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.150
It sure is a problem.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.630
Guys, geez...

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.700
Wait!

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:52.030
Take me with you!

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.530
Kirino...

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:56.480
I want to go too!

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.210
But this is my final decision...

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.500
Excuse me...

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.920
My stomach's been hurting since this morning.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:09.590
It would help me out a good deal if Kirino-senpai took my place instead...

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.180
Kariya...

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.330
Okay then.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.680
In that case, Kirino will join instead!

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.980
Thank you so much!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.680
Then let's go!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.740
Time jump!

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.330
Member change.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:46.660
Rudzik.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.210
Galling.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:48.440
Bahams.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.200
Darna.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:54.180
Allow me to show you what real power is.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.930
I expect the best from you, Gamma.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:01.230
I have heard that the status of your all-around abilities is far greater than Beta's.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.460
Will you be able to defeat Raimon?

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.110
Of course.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.940
In fact, I don't expect much enjoyment from such an easy task as this.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.670
Strong words.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:13.700
Mind that you don't make the same mistakes as Beta.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:18.170
While we're on the subject, was she sent to Mugen Prison?

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.080
That's right.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:24.080
The re-education facility where the specs of a human's body and spirit are enhanced...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.870
Must-Generic Training Center.

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.950
Otherwise known as Mugen Prison.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.800
She must be undergoing their harsh re-education program right about now.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:39.820
Despite being given El Dorado's A-class administrator code of Beta, only to discredit herself in this way...

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:42.380
It's unthinkable.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.000
Now go, Gamma.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.230
Destroy Raimon!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.090
Smart.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.480
He's escaping!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.120
You can't run!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:33.530
So this is the mission that El Dorado is executing right now.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:35.990
Looks interesting.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.880
This... is Jeanne d'Arc's world?

00:17:56.110 --> 00:18:00.700
It's the year 1427 in Vaucouleurs, France.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:14.000
Is this where they are?

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:15.570
Yes, most likely.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.140
Then search for them.

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:18.530
Yes, sir.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.780
Strike Ball.

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:25.420
Who's there?!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.620
I thought you'd say that.

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.050
"Who's there?"

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:33.350
"Who are you? Why are you doing this?"

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.810
Isn't that what you want to say?

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:35.450
Hmm?

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:36.090
How dare you...

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:39.900
I am Zanark Avalonic.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.040
A member of the lower middle class without a name.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.770
A member of the lower middle class without a name, but with a name.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.670
How's that?

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:48.940
I've heard of him.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.360
He is an S-rank criminal.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.570
A fearsome man since there's no telling what he will do.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.280
How interesting.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.610
Then I will take you down!

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:01.600
Take me down, you say?

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.070
The weaker you are, the louder you bark.

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.680
I'm strong, but I have a loud bark.

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:07.500
All right.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.360
But...

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.540
I want all of you to come at me!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:16.500
Submit!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.300
Is that all you've got?

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.390
This will finish you!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.670
Y-You...

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.710
Who is he?

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.940
Zanark Avalonic.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.780
He broke out of Mugen Prison a few hours ago.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.520
Seize him at once!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.300
No, wait.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.440
Hey, you old farts in El Dorado.

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.300
You're watching me, aren't you?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.600
I have an idea.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:15.760
I get rid of the guys who are giving you trouble,
and you write off all the charges against me.

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.860
How's that?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:17.770
You seek a trade?

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.730
That's how it works.

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:23.150
There is no way we will do business with a criminal!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:26.190
Who knows what he's plotting...

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.000
Very well.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.540
We yield to your conditions.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.290
I thought you'd say that.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.170
Now, time to wake up.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.230
As the first step, you guys are going to work for me.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.160
Is that the battlefield?

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:26.820
The enemy... is coming...

00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:55.560
Jeanne d'Arc makes her appearance!

00:22:55.790 --> 00:23:01.200
Will Mixi-max with Jeanne work during this gigantic historical moment?

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.600
Next, The Girl In Armor!

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:05.230
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:19.200
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:27.030
The weaker you are, the louder you bark.
I'm strong, but I have a loud bark!

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:27.630
That's all!
